## Storage

All adapters stored in NeMo Data Store:
- Repo path:    `default/<adapter-name>`
- Revision:     `<job-id>` (Git tag)
- Files URL:    `http://nemo-data-store:3000/v1/hf/default/<adapter-name>/resolve/<job-id>/<filename>`
- Entity ref:   `default/<adapter-name>@<job-id>` (Entity Store)

Each adapter contains both HF PEFT format (adapter_model.safetensors + adapter_config.json) and
NeMo distcp format (weights/__0_*.distcp + context/), enabling NIM-direct serving or further
NeMo workflows.

## Total wall-clock: ~110 minutes for all 12 adapters.

