# Stage 3 MoE Task 4.6 — Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B adapters (2026-05-26 → 2026-05-27)

MoE LoRA on `nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b@v1.0+96GB-singleGPU`, 2 epochs, batch_size=8,
lr=1e-4, α=rank, sequence_packing=false (MoE + Blackwell sm_120 constraint),
warmup_steps=20 (fitted to small datasets: 62-72 optimizer steps with grad_acc=8).
Each adapter is the TIES merge (trim_ratio=0.2) of two LoRA shards trained on
balanced halves of the corresponding curated corpus.

**r=32 abandoned**: cust-U9RnGyiJTxYzGS1Kxrv4bD (nim r=32 shard-a) diverged at
end-of-warmup (loss → 9.0, grad_norm → 1632 at step 18) with α=rank=32, lr=1e-4,
warmup=20. Same dataset/recipe at r=16 trains cleanly. See memory
`feedback_nemotron_nano_r32_divergence` for the divergence trace.

