## MoE wall-clock summary

- Round 1 nim r=16 (2026-05-26): ~3h (job IDs rolled off; not recoverable)
- Round 2 nim r=32 a+b attempts (2026-05-27 00:50): wedged in NFS post-training output copy → reboot required
- Post-reboot recovery (2026-05-27 02:22–05:55): ~3.5h including the warmup-validation discovery,
  r=32 divergence finding, and the serial r=16 nemo-usvcs run + TIES merge
- Combined MoE wall-clock for the 2 final r=16 adapters: ~6.5h actual; would have been ~3h on a clean run

